:name: Zig firmware on the nRF52840 (nice!nano) model
:description: freestanding Zig (thumb, cortex_m4) built with 32_24_microzig's Zig; line commands on uart0.
$elf?=$ex_out/zig_nrf52840.elf

using sysbus
mach create "zig_nrf52840"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../nrf52840_nicenano/nicenano.repl
showAnalyzer uart0
sysbus LoadELF $elf
